  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add unsalted butter and let melt, then add toffee popcorn and stir until well coated.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together cocoa powder, brown sugar, and kosher salt. Add to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Add crushed hazelnuts and pomegranate seeds, and stir until well mixed.",
    "Pour in heavy cream and vanilla extract, and stir until a jammy sauce forms.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly, until the sauce thickens slightly.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving dish and let cool slightly before serving."
